WEBVTT

00:00:01.180 --> 00:00:08.350
Stepping out on
an ordinary Sunday

00:00:08.350 --> 00:00:14.860
Stepping out!
A miracle's gonna happen

00:00:14.860 --> 00:00:16.690
It's my day!

00:00:22.800 --> 00:00:27.270
Maybe I'll throw off my pajamas

00:00:29.740 --> 00:00:34.680
and head out to see her right now

00:00:36.650 --> 00:00:42.050
I always turned my eyes away,
thinking she'd hate me

00:00:43.720 --> 00:00:49.460
Now I'm saying goodbye
to that negative attitude

00:00:50.660 --> 00:00:55.230
My favorite shoes
will always take me

00:00:57.730 --> 00:01:02.370
To a place where I'll be happy

00:01:04.540 --> 00:01:09.880
It's not someone else
I want to embrace

00:01:11.580 --> 00:01:16.020
But a version of
myself that's not fake

00:01:16.020 --> 00:01:19.090
I just want to walk

00:01:19.420 --> 00:01:22.630
Not on tip-toe

00:01:22.860 --> 00:01:26.600
Not downcast, either

00:01:27.560 --> 00:01:35.500
Just I'm stepping out
on an ordinary Sunday

00:01:35.500 --> 00:01:41.940
Stepping out!
Making a little try, try, try

00:01:41.940 --> 00:01:44.210
It's my day!

00:02:08.270 --> 00:02:09.310
...let's go on a date.

00:02:10.840 --> 00:02:11.540
What was that?

00:02:12.710 --> 00:02:15.310
Got it? I'll tell you the day later.

00:02:17.080 --> 00:02:18.180
<i>What was he saying?</i>

00:02:20.280 --> 00:02:21.820
Wait, Domyoji!

00:02:22.450 --> 00:02:30.700
"A Date In The Snow"

00:02:34.160 --> 00:02:36.930
Rui must have met up
with Shizuka by now.

00:02:37.930 --> 00:02:41.770
Yeah. Boy, when he goes for it,
he goes for it big time.

00:02:46.740 --> 00:02:48.040
Hey! Tsukasa!

00:02:49.410 --> 00:02:50.680
What are you looking at?

00:02:53.280 --> 00:02:53.880
Whoa!

00:02:54.180 --> 00:02:57.720
Tsukasa, who won't even touch 
a newspaper... reading?!

00:02:58.750 --> 00:02:59.720
Hand it over!

00:03:00.020 --> 00:03:01.730
Hey! What are you doing?!

00:03:03.860 --> 00:03:05.690
"A Guide To Dating"?!

00:03:05.990 --> 00:03:07.470
You've got a date?!

00:03:08.730 --> 00:03:10.230
With who?

00:03:10.700 --> 00:03:14.230
I know. It's that model from
Shizuka's party.

00:03:14.700 --> 00:03:16.970
Yeah, you could say that.

00:03:18.040 --> 00:03:20.620
Bullying was the only thing 
you ever showed interest in...

00:03:20.620 --> 00:03:22.640
I thought there was something
wrong with you.

00:03:23.040 --> 00:03:25.840
So you've got yourself a date, huh?

00:03:26.310 --> 00:03:28.300
Okay, leave everything to us.

00:03:28.300 --> 00:03:30.950
First, ditch the magazine.

00:03:38.790 --> 00:03:41.580
The stuff in this guide's
for losers...

00:03:41.580 --> 00:03:43.530
...and every woman knows it.

00:03:44.830 --> 00:03:46.800
You can't beat
taking her to Aoyama.

00:03:47.730 --> 00:03:50.110
You could do a cruise on
Tokyo Bay at twilight.

00:03:50.900 --> 00:03:53.370
Next, head out to a club or two...

00:03:55.310 --> 00:03:58.120
...have a gimlet at the hotel bar...

00:03:59.580 --> 00:04:02.130
...then a short trip to the suite
you've booked upstairs...

00:04:02.130 --> 00:04:04.110
...and you can chalk up
one happy date.

00:04:05.350 --> 00:04:06.220
Uh, okay... I see.

00:04:06.720 --> 00:04:08.090
Of course! That's right...

00:04:10.480 --> 00:04:12.460
But wow...

00:04:12.460 --> 00:04:14.130
...you're popping your cherry at last!

00:04:17.030 --> 00:04:18.290
Don't say that!

00:04:28.800 --> 00:04:32.780
<i>I wonder if Rui Hanazawa actually managed
to meet up with Shizuka...</i>

00:04:34.810 --> 00:04:39.780
Pathetic. Pining for Hanazawa after
he followed Shizuka to Paris.

00:04:40.120 --> 00:04:41.450
That's just sad.

00:04:41.820 --> 00:04:44.300
At least she knows
how far beneath him she is.

00:04:47.820 --> 00:04:50.800
Tsukushi... 
I brought yakisoba bread.

00:04:51.860 --> 00:04:53.330
Ah... thanks.

00:04:54.300 --> 00:04:57.020
It should be a crime
for someone so ordinary...

00:04:57.020 --> 00:04:58.930
...to compete with
the likes of Shizuka.

00:05:10.850 --> 00:05:14.220
Sunday. One o'clock.
The Hanae Mori Building on Omotesando.

00:05:15.920 --> 00:05:16.580
Wha?

00:05:31.330 --> 00:05:33.020
What was that?

00:05:33.020 --> 00:05:35.240
What did he say?

00:05:35.740 --> 00:05:37.950
I don't know. I couldn't hear.

00:05:38.970 --> 00:05:40.510
Tsukushi, what was that
all about?

00:05:42.980 --> 00:05:46.250
<i>Sunday... one o'clock...
Omotesando...</i>

00:05:47.050 --> 00:05:52.930
He asked you for a date!
No way! Not <i>my</i> Tsukushi...

00:05:53.350 --> 00:05:54.020
What?

00:05:56.460 --> 00:05:58.260
I said it out loud!
It's nothing!

00:06:02.300 --> 00:06:07.770
<i>A date? Can't be.
There's just no way he'd ask me.</i>

00:06:09.600 --> 00:06:10.600
<i>I mean... would he?</i>

00:06:14.570 --> 00:06:18.380
Why's the weather so bad
on a Sunday?

00:06:18.380 --> 00:06:19.780
It looks like snow!

00:06:20.110 --> 00:06:23.220
Let's finish shopping and
get home, Tsukushi.

00:06:25.980 --> 00:06:28.630
Tsukushi?
Why are you daydreaming?

00:06:30.260 --> 00:06:32.360
Just carry this. Here.

00:06:35.960 --> 00:06:38.500
Oh! Mom... what time is it?

00:06:39.100 --> 00:06:42.300
Hm? Oh... about 1:30.

00:06:43.270 --> 00:06:44.040
Uh, thanks...

00:06:44.740 --> 00:06:46.620
Good day. What can I do for you?

00:06:47.140 --> 00:06:50.440
We just got these in fresh...
they're delicious.

00:06:50.980 --> 00:06:55.670
Let's see... what? That's too much!
I'll need a better price than that!

00:06:55.670 --> 00:06:57.110
You're tough...
Tell you what I'll do...

00:06:57.110 --> 00:06:58.130
<i>One-thirty...</i>

00:07:01.890 --> 00:07:05.520
<i>Sunday. One o'clock.
The Hanae Mori Building on Omotesando.</i>

00:07:11.160 --> 00:07:14.800
<i>What was that about?
Without any warning...</i>

00:07:17.630 --> 00:07:19.620
Look! A sale!

00:07:20.370 --> 00:07:22.790
I know. Your father needs
new underwear.

00:07:22.790 --> 00:07:25.010
He's been wearing the 
same ones for three years.

00:07:25.740 --> 00:07:27.280
Wait for me here, Tsukushi.

00:07:29.680 --> 00:07:33.920
<i>He couldn't possibly still be waiting,
could he?</i>

00:07:46.200 --> 00:07:50.300
<i>Why am I thinking?
I don't owe him anything.</i>

00:07:52.600 --> 00:07:57.870
<i>Why should I waste
my Sunday on him?</i>

00:08:11.890 --> 00:08:14.820
There, it's finally snowing.

00:08:18.590 --> 00:08:20.530
First snow of the year.

00:08:39.580 --> 00:08:41.700
Whoa! It's already 3:30!

00:08:43.320 --> 00:08:45.850
We've got to have dinner
on the table soon!

00:08:46.920 --> 00:08:49.410
Tsukushi! 
What are you doing? Come on!

00:08:51.760 --> 00:08:55.710
It'll be a good dinner tonight for a change.
Your father'll love it!

00:09:00.330 --> 00:09:01.640
What's the matter, Tsukushi?

00:09:02.340 --> 00:09:06.370
Mom, I'll be back. I have to go
to Omotesando.

00:09:07.070 --> 00:09:10.740
What?! Hold on there!

00:09:17.780 --> 00:09:18.720
<i>There's no way...</i>

00:09:22.690 --> 00:09:23.740
<i>There's just no way...</i>

00:09:29.330 --> 00:09:32.060
Oo, check out that hottie.

00:09:32.430 --> 00:09:33.990
Should we try and pick him up?

00:09:34.930 --> 00:09:37.320
Hi! Wanna go for a cup of coffee?

00:09:37.320 --> 00:09:40.010
No umbrella? You can share ours...

00:09:41.840 --> 00:09:44.840
Shut up! I'm not interested, ugly!

00:09:47.380 --> 00:09:49.350
<i>He's still here!</i>

00:09:52.220 --> 00:09:56.320
What are you doing here?
Have you lost your mind?!

00:09:59.020 --> 00:10:02.530
<i>My</i> mind?!
Do you know what time it is?!

00:10:03.330 --> 00:10:04.720
<i>He'll hit me...</i>

00:10:13.470 --> 00:10:14.110
<i>Huh?</i>

00:10:17.610 --> 00:10:20.030
S-so cold...

00:10:20.780 --> 00:10:21.350
Argh!

00:10:22.680 --> 00:10:24.680
What are you doing, you perv?!

00:10:26.120 --> 00:10:29.300
What do you think? 
You made me wait four hours!

00:10:29.300 --> 00:10:30.850
Who the hell
do you think you are?

00:10:33.020 --> 00:10:34.910
How are you gonna
make it up to me, huh?

00:10:35.290 --> 00:10:37.530
F-four hours?

00:10:38.090 --> 00:10:41.260
Why did you wait so long?
Why didn't you just go home?

00:10:41.830 --> 00:10:44.920
I thought you were in an accident
or something. Okay?!

00:10:53.080 --> 00:10:54.040
I'm so cold...

00:10:58.710 --> 00:10:59.820
<i>Four hours?</i>

00:11:01.220 --> 00:11:03.120
<i>He thought I was in an accident?</i>

00:11:23.710 --> 00:11:24.640
Stand up.

00:11:30.350 --> 00:11:32.610
You need some hot tea. My treat.

00:11:33.080 --> 00:11:34.920
You <i>bet</i> it's your treat,
you idiot!

00:11:35.850 --> 00:11:38.420
<i>He's so infuriating!</i>

00:12:02.710 --> 00:12:03.900
<i>He makes me so mad!!</i>

00:12:03.900 --> 00:12:06.440
<i>He picked the date, waited, 
and got mad... all on his terms!</i>

00:12:07.940 --> 00:12:09.040
Hey there!

00:12:09.040 --> 00:12:10.960
I'll give you free movie tickets...

00:12:10.960 --> 00:12:12.810
...just for answering this survey!

00:12:12.810 --> 00:12:14.710
Huh? Um, well...

00:12:15.260 --> 00:12:17.700
You're visiting from
out of town, right?

00:12:17.700 --> 00:12:20.060
How much did you bring
for spending money?

00:12:20.390 --> 00:12:21.960
None of your business.

00:12:28.970 --> 00:12:30.970
Sorry! It was nothing!

00:12:33.270 --> 00:12:34.840
Ow! Hey, let go!

00:12:35.440 --> 00:12:37.810
Quiet, you! We're going in here.

00:12:38.710 --> 00:12:41.770
<i>Whoa, this place looks expensive!</i>

00:12:42.280 --> 00:12:43.680
Hold on a minute!

00:12:50.190 --> 00:12:52.260
<i>I've only got 1,500 yen!</i>

00:12:53.290 --> 00:12:55.770
I know! There's a nice place
around the corner...

00:12:55.770 --> 00:12:57.420
How about we go over there?

00:12:57.630 --> 00:13:00.730
I'm freezing to death! Hurry up!

00:13:01.100 --> 00:13:02.900
Oh, quit your whining!
It's not far.

00:13:12.140 --> 00:13:13.770
See? It's up on the fourth floor.

00:13:13.770 --> 00:13:16.350
Most reasonable desserts in town.

00:13:23.390 --> 00:13:26.790
<i>Hm... their sign is gone. I wonder...</i>

00:13:28.460 --> 00:13:29.850
Come on, let's go in!

00:13:31.860 --> 00:13:34.370
I've never eaten in 
a place this run-down.

00:13:36.070 --> 00:13:37.500
Looks can be deceiving.

00:13:42.370 --> 00:13:43.670
What happened?

00:13:44.370 --> 00:13:45.480
It stopped...

00:13:52.750 --> 00:13:54.280
You are kidding me!

00:13:55.720 --> 00:13:57.020
You hunk of junk!

00:13:57.520 --> 00:14:00.190
Hey! Help! Anyone out there?!

00:14:15.040 --> 00:14:17.700
Um... so, have you got the time?

00:14:23.780 --> 00:14:27.450
<i>Domyoji hasn't said a word to me.
What can I do?</i>

00:14:28.520 --> 00:14:29.250
<i>I know!</i>

00:14:34.260 --> 00:14:36.730
Okay, Domyoji...
put your fingers on this.

00:14:38.760 --> 00:14:39.860
Come on, hurry.

00:14:42.260 --> 00:14:43.110
Answer this:

00:14:43.110 --> 00:14:46.630
Were you interested in the girls
who tried to pick you up?

00:14:49.440 --> 00:14:51.870
That's stupid! Of course not!

00:15:14.960 --> 00:15:17.030
<i>Phew... need some fresh air...</i>

00:15:27.240 --> 00:15:28.940
<i>I can't take off my coat...</i>

00:15:29.580 --> 00:15:31.610
<i>...my shirt shows too much...</i>

00:15:49.930 --> 00:15:51.700
Um, Makino...

00:15:52.670 --> 00:15:55.000
Don't get all heated up there...

00:15:55.530 --> 00:15:57.770
Don't come any closer!
I'll bite my tongue off and die!

00:15:58.540 --> 00:16:00.340
Get away! I kick hard!

00:16:01.910 --> 00:16:03.040
I don't feel very good...

00:16:05.040 --> 00:16:06.210
You animal!

00:16:07.550 --> 00:16:08.690
You filthy...

00:16:08.690 --> 00:16:12.050
I warned you!
Try something 150 years later!

00:16:13.890 --> 00:16:15.350
<i>Why isn't he fighting back?</i>

00:16:22.890 --> 00:16:23.730
Domyoji?

00:16:32.340 --> 00:16:34.310
Oh, no... he's got a wicked fever!

00:16:35.110 --> 00:16:36.140
You...

00:16:37.440 --> 00:16:38.510
How dare you...

00:16:38.880 --> 00:16:41.730
Why didn't you tell me
you were sick?

00:16:41.730 --> 00:16:43.250
I thought you were gonna...

00:16:48.990 --> 00:16:50.850
<i>Scolding won't help him.</i>

00:16:51.320 --> 00:16:55.060
<i>The elevator's stuck,
and nobody's coming to help.</i>

00:16:55.630 --> 00:16:56.930
I'm cold...

00:16:57.960 --> 00:17:00.430
<i>Plus, he's running a fever.</i>

00:17:01.830 --> 00:17:05.040
<i>'Course, that's what happens
if you sit in the snow for hours.</i>

00:17:05.570 --> 00:17:08.510
<i>And he's done worse things to me...</i>

00:17:08.940 --> 00:17:10.910
<i>...so why should I care?</i>

00:17:17.710 --> 00:17:20.520
Hey, what? You're gonna strangle me?!

00:17:21.180 --> 00:17:24.150
Shut up!
Leeks bring a fever down.

00:17:24.450 --> 00:17:26.960
Leeks stink, too!
Leave me alone!

00:17:27.590 --> 00:17:29.230
Be quiet and do what I say!

00:17:30.560 --> 00:17:31.360
Uh-huh...

00:17:31.960 --> 00:17:32.560
Okay!

00:17:40.070 --> 00:17:42.050
Now, you've got to get a grip.

00:17:42.050 --> 00:17:44.870
Someone should at least be coming
in the morning.

00:17:48.040 --> 00:17:51.580
<i>I can't stand him,
but I can't ignore him, either.</i>

00:17:56.850 --> 00:17:58.820
I'm sorry to be such trouble...

00:18:03.190 --> 00:18:07.900
...but it's your fault anyway,
so deal with it.

00:18:09.430 --> 00:18:12.430
<i>Heh... such a big guy,
with a leek wrapped 'round his neck...</i>

00:18:12.430 --> 00:18:15.340
<i>...hard to believe he leads the F4.</i>

00:18:17.640 --> 00:18:19.670
Don't laugh at me! It's not funny.

00:18:20.940 --> 00:18:22.280
<i>Still, he's kinda cute...</i>

00:18:25.280 --> 00:18:27.280
Sorry, but I'm the only nurse
you've got.

00:18:27.880 --> 00:18:29.920
Your mama can take care of you
when you get home.

00:18:32.320 --> 00:18:34.760
I haven't seen my 
parents in two years.

00:18:36.190 --> 00:18:39.960
Dad's job keeps them in New York
all the time.

00:18:41.560 --> 00:18:44.270
You have a house
in New York, too?

00:18:47.500 --> 00:18:50.770
So you're all alone in that mansion?

00:18:54.440 --> 00:18:58.080
<i>No wonder he's so bizarre.</i>

00:19:00.580 --> 00:19:03.080
You... you must get lonely there.

00:19:04.450 --> 00:19:08.330
Lonely? Don't be silly.

00:19:17.630 --> 00:19:21.900
I'm sorry about today.
I'll even let you get me back...

00:19:23.840 --> 00:19:25.770
Go on. Take your best shot.

00:19:49.860 --> 00:19:51.160
Hey! Wait a minute...

00:20:14.480 --> 00:20:17.030
Hey! What's going on in here?

00:20:17.450 --> 00:20:20.940
We're tearing the building down!
It's condemned!

00:20:20.940 --> 00:20:22.470
No trespassers allowed!

00:20:22.870 --> 00:20:24.740
No trespassers?

00:20:25.060 --> 00:20:29.070
You bet. The elevators were
shut down at 6PM.

00:20:29.630 --> 00:20:34.340
If you two lovebirds want some alone time, 
you'll have to get a hotel room.

00:20:42.080 --> 00:20:43.610
How are you getting home?

00:20:43.950 --> 00:20:46.320
I'll take the train.
Gotta get to class.

00:20:52.150 --> 00:20:52.820
Makino...

00:21:03.200 --> 00:21:04.630
Oh, nothing.

00:21:10.270 --> 00:21:12.150
See you... Have a safe trip home.

00:21:19.410 --> 00:21:21.420
<i>What was that all about?</i>

00:21:30.630 --> 00:21:33.710
<i>He barks an invitation at me,
he waits for hours...</i>

00:21:33.710 --> 00:21:36.260
<i>...and he even tries to kiss me.</i>

00:21:36.800 --> 00:21:38.780
<i>Could he have feelings for me?</i>

00:21:39.330 --> 00:21:41.270
What?! No way!

00:22:05.530 --> 00:22:11.600
You let your hair down a little

00:22:13.570 --> 00:22:19.470
You hid the fact
that you were crying

00:22:21.240 --> 00:22:29.350
I noticed, but I
couldn't ask you why

00:22:29.580 --> 00:22:37.390
I can never be
honest about how I feel

00:22:37.390 --> 00:22:45.160
Until after we've split
up after a bad fight

00:22:45.430 --> 00:22:53.300
I can say it now,
though, over and over

00:22:45.430 --> 00:22:53.300
(Sorry girl, I was
wrong and I love you)

00:22:53.300 --> 00:23:01.680
I can say "I love you"...

00:22:53.300 --> 00:23:01.680
(Sorry girl, I was
wrong and I love you)

00:23:03.480 --> 00:23:11.460
Do you really hate me this time?

00:23:11.460 --> 00:23:19.230
Will you end up running to him?

00:23:19.500 --> 00:23:27.400
I can say it now,
though, over and over

00:23:19.500 --> 00:23:27.400
(Sorry girl, I was
wrong and I love you)

00:23:27.400 --> 00:23:35.810
I can say "I love you"...

00:23:27.400 --> 00:23:35.810
(Sorry girl, I was
wrong and I love you)

00:23:49.030 --> 00:23:52.130
I get dragged off to a club in Roppongi,
and I meet Thomas.

00:23:52.930 --> 00:23:55.770
His blue marble eyes looked
strangely familiar...

00:23:57.000 --> 00:23:59.940
Now what do I do?
I'm getting drawn in...

00:24:00.740 --> 00:24:03.040
...just like I was with Rui Hanazawa.

00:24:04.670 --> 00:24:07.740
Next on Hana Yori Dango:
"Love Moves Too Fast"
